# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TMS -- what goes to GitHub
#
# Only the application code needed to build, run and update TMS belongs in
# this repository. Everything private or personal stays on the local PC:
# secrets, the live database and its keys, uploads, backups, design notes,
# Word/PDF documents, mockups and one-off data scripts.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Secrets -- never commit
.env
*.key
secret_key

# Live data: database, encryption keys, uploads, exports, backups
instance/
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
Backups/
backups/

# Notes, design documents and office files (keep these on the PC only)
General Notes/
Organization Intelligence/
Design Notes*/
Forms Mockups/
Input Data/
Claude outputs/
*.docx
*.doc
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.pptx
*.pdf
*.lnk
*.jbf
HOTEL_AGENT_CAPABILITIES.md

# One-off data fix / populate scripts (already applied to the local database)
fix_*.py
populate_*.py

# Python / tooling
venv/
**/venv/
.venv/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.idea/
.vscode/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
